        "TileImage": "$($repository b833e5e9-a8f9-4866-88ea-6c46730caf1c).Image",
        "Description": "On one of the older episodes of True Crime by Tom and Jerry ChumpChange,the pair discuss a series of murders starting in Sapienza,Italy.The identity,while unknown,has been dubbed the homemade killer,as the victims have been found with wounds of everyday objects,most notably a measuring tape and scissors.\r\rThis is the reenactment of one of many killings by the homemade killer.",
